==English==
{{was wotd|2013|January|1}}

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*keh₂p-}}
Late {{inh|en|enm|-}}, borrowed from {{bor|en|la|inceptiō}}, from {{m|la|inceptus}}, Perfect passive participle of {{m|la|incipiō||I begin}}.

The ''layering'' sense derives from the 2010 science fiction film ''{{w|Inception|Inception}}'', in which a team of people infiltrate someone’s subconscious mind, proceeding through several layers of dreams with the goal of causing someone to [[incept]] an idea.

